# Local-only runtime artifacts -- databases and encrypted stores built by
# FalkorDBLite / EncryptedJsonlStore during development or test runs, never
# meant to be committed. Found tracked by accident (a 29MB data/falkordb_lite.db
# had been swept into a commit by `git add -A`), removed, and guarded here
# against recurring. Named precisely, not a blanket data/*.db or data/*.jsonl
# pattern -- data/ also holds real, tracked project data
# (literature_vectors.jsonl, literature_index_concepts.json,
# maxo-annotations.tsv), which a broader pattern would risk shadowing. The
# HPO release files (hp.obo, phenotype.hpoa, genes_to_*, phenotype_to_genes)
# are tracked by DVC, not git: their *.dvc files are committed, and DVC's
# own data/.gitignore keeps the files themselves out of git.
data/falkordb_lite.db
data/falkordb_lite.db.salt
data/nexus_candidates.jsonl
data/nexus_candidates.jsonl.salt
data/nexus_queue.jsonl
data/nexus_queue.jsonl.salt
data/confirmed_cases.jsonl
data/confirmed_cases.jsonl.salt
data/confirmation_registry.jsonl
data/confirmation_registry.jsonl.salt
